title: Toasting Fork
text: Turn a prism to a different face and it keeps one colour back. Make a toasting fork with a red prong and a green one, and nothing between them.
trick: split; a prism turned another way swallows blue
motif: two-pronged fork
ink: 2.5
expect: recolours>=1
